invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser_ext.c
catches: srv_test
reason: read_psk_identities admits an identities list under 7 bytes, which
  RFC 9846 §4.3.11 bounds at <7..2^16-1> because one PskIdentity costs a
  two-byte length, at least one identity byte and a four-byte
  obfuscated_ticket_age. An empty list runs no walk and leaves
  truncated_len counting over no identity at all.
  test/srv_parser_tests.h sends that empty list.

--- old
    if (e->err || *identities_len < PSK_IDENTITIES_MIN || *identities_len > rb_left(e)) {
--- new
    if (e->err || *identities_len > rb_left(e)) {
